@startuml Sequence_3
hide footbox
title Scenario 3: Enemy Turn — Goblin Attack Reduced by Warrior's DefendBuff

participant "BattleEngine" as Engine
participant "Goblin" as Goblin
participant "BasicEnemyActionStrategy" as Strategy
participant "Warrior" as Warrior
participant "DefendBuff" as Buff
participant "GameApp" as App

note over Engine, App
  Continuation of the same executePlayerTurn() call as Scenario 2.
  Warrior (SPD 30) already defended — DefendBuff is now active (turns=2, boost=+10).
  Now processing: Goblin (SPD 25) in the enemy phase.
end note

Engine -> Goblin : beginTurn()
note over Goblin : No active effects\ncanAct = true
Goblin --> Engine : true

Engine -> Goblin : getStrategy()
Goblin --> Engine : BasicEnemyActionStrategy

Engine -> Strategy : execute(goblin, [warrior])
Strategy -> Warrior : isAlive()
Warrior --> Strategy : true
Strategy -> Goblin : getAttack()
Goblin --> Strategy : 35

Strategy -> Warrior : getDefense()
note over Warrior : Iterates activeEffects\ncalls DefendBuff.modifyDefense(20)
Warrior -> Buff : modifyDefense(20)
note over Buff : returns 20 + defenseBoost(10) = 30
Buff --> Warrior : 30
Warrior --> Strategy : 30

note over Strategy : damage = max(0, 35 − 30) = 5\nReduced vs Scenario 1 (was 15)

Strategy -> Warrior : takeDamage(5, goblin)
note over Warrior : Iterates activeEffects\nDefendBuff.modifyIncomingDamage(5,...) = 5 (no override)\nhp -= 5
Warrior --> Strategy : 5

Engine -> Engine : lastPlayerDamage = 5
Engine -> Engine : pendingTurnFrames.add(TurnFrame("Goblin attacks.", damage=5))
Engine -> Engine : sweepDeadEnemies()
note over Engine : Goblin alive — nothing removed

note over Engine : All combatants processed.\ncheckEndCondition → 0 → endRound()

Engine --> App : 0 (continue)
App -> Engine : drainTurnFrames()
App -> App : render TurnFrame (floatingDamage=5 on Warrior)

@enduml
